Round-2 lab stacks on Vertex from India: every call completed with 0 errors. Reply gap (caller end of speech to first audio sent, server_ms):
- v2-live (Gemini 3.8 Live, us-central1): 1.20 / 1.46 / 1.09 s, ₹1.90/min;
- v2-mai (Azure ears + Flash-Lite + MAI-Voice): 2.06 / 1.76 / 1.81 s, ₹1.56/min;
- v2-flashlite (Azure ears + Flash-Lite + Gemini 3.8 Flash-Lite TTS): 2.69 / 2.37 / 2.00 s, ₹1.55/min;
- v2-38flash: 2.60 / 2.68 s, ₹1.21/min.
The disclosure 'AI assistant' was spoken in each.
